              "name": "prompts",
              "value": "[\"Minimalist black and white hand-drawn stickman illustration, character packing a backpack and holding a map, standing at the door of a small house, sunny morning, thick black outlines, simple round head, subtle grey shading, white background, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"Minimalist black and white hand-drawn stickman illustration, character walking into a dense forest holding a compass, tall simple tree shapes, thick black outlines, subtle grey shading, white background, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"Minimalist black and white hand-drawn stickman illustration, character carefully crossing a wobbly wooden bridge over a stream, arms out for balance, thick black outlines, subtle grey shading, white background, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"Minimalist black and white hand-drawn stickman illustration, character scratching his head looking confused, holding a torn map, surrounded by trees, thick black outlines, subtle grey shading, white background, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"Minimalist black and white hand-drawn stickman illustration, character looking up worried at dark storm clouds gathering, first raindrops falling, thick black outlines, subtle grey shading, white background, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"Minimalist black and white hand-drawn stickman illustration, character shivering, taking shelter under a large tree in heavy rain, arms wrapped around knees, thick black outlines, subtle grey shading, white background, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"Minimalist black and white hand-drawn stickman illustration, character discovering an old abandoned wooden cabin in the forest, rain stopping, thick black outlines, subtle grey shading, white background, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"Minimalist black and white hand-drawn stickman illustration, character inside the cabin, pointing at an old mysterious map pinned on the wall, candle light, thick black outlines, subtle grey shading, white background, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"Minimalist black and white hand-drawn stickman illustration, character sitting by a small campfire outside the cabin at night, stars in the sky, thoughtful expression, thick black outlines, subtle grey shading, white background, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"Minimalist black and white hand-drawn stickman illustration, character standing up determined at sunrise, picking up his backpack, warm morning light, thick black outlines, subtle grey shading, white background, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"Minimalist black and white hand-drawn stickman illustration, character climbing a steep rocky hill, gripping rocks, effort on his face, thick black outlines, subtle grey shading, white background, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"Minimalist black and white hand-drawn stickman illustration, character standing at the top of the hill, looking out over a wide valley, spotting a distant lighthouse, thick black outlines, subtle grey shading, white background, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"Minimalist black and white hand-drawn stickman illustration, character sliding down a rocky slope, arms flailing, slightly off balance, thick black outlines, subtle grey shading, white background, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"Minimalist black and white hand-drawn stickman illustration, character carefully hopping across stepping stones over a river, focused expression, thick black outlines, subtle grey shading, white background, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"Minimalist black and white hand-drawn stickman illustration, character crouching, meeting a small friendly fox in a clearing, curious expression, thick black outlines, subtle grey shading, white background, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"Minimalist black and white hand-drawn stickman illustration, character following the fox through an open meadow, walking side by side, thick black outlines, subtle grey shading, white background, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"Minimalist black and white hand-drawn stickman illustration, character pointing excitedly at smoke rising from a distant village, hopeful expression, thick black outlines, subtle grey shading, white